PROPERTY  RINDEX
# UNITS  nm\E 1
OPTION wavelength
#this is extrapolation following the shifted shape of 
#GMURTAZA et al, Structural, elastic, electronic and optical properties of bi-alkali #antimonides
#https://www.ias.ac.in/article/fulltext/boms/039/06/1581-1591
#the shift comes from comparison of the curve from Motta (measurement) and Gmurtaza (calculation)
310 0.9
# "Optical properties of bialkali photocathodes" D. Motta, S. Schonert. Table 3, KCsSb
